  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What lessons about human potential and the spirit of overcoming adversity can be drawn from this extract?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the impact of the film adaptation and Daniel Day-Lewis's portrayal on the public perception and understanding of Christy Brown's story.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the passage illustrate the idea that true expression can transcend physical barriers?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('66aecfce-bb20-40e1-afaf-c67010e64b56', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The author, born on June 5th, 1932, in the Rotunda Hospital, presented with concerning symptoms early in life. At four months old, the mother noticed the author's head falling backwards during feeding. As the author grew, other defects became apparent: hands were often clenched and inclined to twine behind the back, and the mouth struggled to grasp a bottle due to jaws that would either lock tightly or become limp, dragging the mouth to one side. By six and twelve months, the author could not sit up without extensive pillow support. Medical professionals consistently labeled the case as 'interesting but hopeless,' with many diagnosing the author as 'mentally defective.' This prognosis was a significant blow to the mother, who had already successfully raised five healthy children, and her continued faith in her child was perceived as 'impertinent' by the doctors. Faced with no medical solutions, the mother resolved to take matters into her own hands, believing her child was an integral part of the family.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 27, NULL),
  ('296a44c3-af04-4b49-895b-90aa9685f7c6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$At the age of five, the author was described as exhibiting significant developmental delays, showing 'no real sign of intelligence' and being physically characterized as 'a little bundle of crooked muscles and twisted nerves.' His world was primarily engaged through his toes, particularly the left foot, and he relied entirely on his father for personal care. A pivotal moment occurred on a cold December day when, observing his siblings, he was drawn to a piece of yellow chalk. This led to an impulsive act where he used his left foot to take the chalk and make a 'wild sort of scribble' on a slate, marking a profound shift in his life.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('abaf6d5a-6c3f-4bc3-a98b-b8f4e48b4dea', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative highlights a strong family unit, particularly the mother's unwavering support, stemming from a 'momentous decision' to 'help me fight all the battles.' The father also played a crucial role in the author's personal care. On a cold December afternoon, the entire family gathered around the kitchen fire, with siblings Mona and Paddy engaged in schoolwork. This familial setting, coupled with the siblings' activities, provided the backdrop for the author's first significant interaction with his environment, leading to a profound change in his life trajectory.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('a3630aff-55dd-403c-8f95-80c55d1d2288', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text vividly describes a sudden, transformative event: 'In a moment, everything was changed; my future life moulded into a definite shape.' This breakthrough, occurring on a 'cold, grey December day,' involved an impulsive act by the author using his left foot to manipulate a piece of chalk. Prior to this, he showed 'no real sign of intelligence' and was physically limited. The event was not a gradual process but a swift, decisive moment that rewarded his mother's faith and turned her 'secret fear' into 'open triumph.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('67857f14-9baa-4d10-bc3d-528d267d7e49', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Before the pivotal event, the author's primary engagement with the world was through his toes, particularly his left foot. His fascination was piqued by a bright yellow chalk, which 'showed up so well against the slate’s black surface.' This visual contrast, combined with the novelty of the object, compelled him to reach out with his left foot, grasp the chalk, and make a scribble. This sensory experience, involving sight and touch through his toes, was instrumental in his first deliberate interaction.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('7b58e6a9-2b57-41c3-ad11-eecad8285383', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The author's early life was marked by significant physical and intellectual challenges, described as a 'little bundle of crooked muscles and twisted nerves' with 'no real sign of intelligence.' Yet, a 'momentous decision' by his mother provided a foundation of unwavering support, promising to 'help me fight all the battles.' The sudden act of making a scribble with his left foot transformed his future, turning his mother's 'secret fear' into 'open triumph,' offering immense hope where there was once only limitation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('f743d67b-9883-4407-ab04-32c98b1e280b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The excerpt details a profound personal transformation, initiated by a seemingly small, impulsive act. A five-year-old, previously showing no signs of intelligence and physically challenged, used his left foot to interact with a piece of chalk, making a scribble. This event, witnessed by his family, dramatically altered his life trajectory and rewarded his mother's enduring faith. It serves as a powerful testament to the potential for unexpected development and the critical impact of a supportive environment.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('b85ba2af-4faf-4184-821f-8f5d0e2496f8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The author's description of himself at five years old as 'a little bundle of crooked muscles and twisted nerves' and showing 'no real sign of intelligence' paints a vivid picture of his early challenges. This physical and cognitive state underscores the magnitude of his later breakthrough. His primary interaction was limited to his toes, particularly the left foot, highlighting a restricted engagement with his environment.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('be13ff5c-37b7-4c04-85f7-58e591fb141f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy Brown, a young boy with severe physical disabilities, found himself at a critical juncture in his life. Unable to speak with his lips, his mind yearned for expression. One day, in a room filled with silent, tense family members, his mother presented him with a piece of chalk and the challenge to copy the letter 'A' using his foot. Despite initial failures and the breaking of the chalk, Christy, with his mother's unwavering support, persevered. His eventual success in drawing the letter 'A' marked the beginning of his journey into literacy and mental freedom, transforming his life and offering him a lasting voice through written words.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f3a8f567-5ccf-4b5a-806a-593d8f9c5812', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The scene unfolds with palpable tension: 'everyone had stopped talking and was staring at me silently. Nobody moved.' Mona, Christy's sister, watched with 'big eyes and an open mouth,' while his father sat 'leaning forward, his shoulders tense and his hands outspread on his knees.' It was into this charged atmosphere that Christy's mother entered, immediately sensing the 'tension flowing through the room.' Her subsequent actions—kneeling beside Christy, slowly drawing the letter 'A', and offering quiet encouragement—gradually shifted the mood, culminating in tears of joy and his father hoisting him onto his shoulder after Christy's success.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7c68b59f-c81e-4ab2-a1b7-cbff554edcb1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy Brown's autobiography, 'My Left Foot,' from which this extract is taken, chronicles his life with cerebral palsy and his extraordinary journey to become a writer and painter. The story highlights the profound impact of family support, personal perseverance, and the transformative power of communication. The film adaptation, starring Daniel Day-Lewis who won an Academy Award for his role, brought Brown's story to a wider audience, emphasizing his struggle, his ability, and his ultimate triumph over adversity. His work continues to inspire, demonstrating that physical limitations do not define one's potential for intellectual and creative expression.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('db742368-6a7a-4da2-9584-47fc93cd6632', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The moment Christy successfully drew the letter 'A' was not merely an act of copying; it was 'the thing that was to give my mind its chance of expressing itself.' For someone who 'couldn't speak with my lips,' this single letter, 'scribbled on the floor with a broken bit of yellow chalk gripped between my toes,' became his 'road to a new world, my key to mental freedom.' This breakthrough established written words as a medium 'more lasting than spoken words,' fundamentally altering his future and providing him with a voice that would endure.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('01d0f1e6-1188-489d-9b67-5a0ccd572a00', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mona, her black curls framing her chubby little face, staring at me with big eyes and an open mouth. Across the open hearth, his face lit by flames, sat my father, leaning forward, his shoulders tense and his hands outspread on his knees. I felt the sweat break out on my forehead. My mother came in from the pantry. She stopped midway between the table and the fire, feeling the tension flowing through the room. Her eyes looked from my face down to my foot, with the chalk gripped between my toes.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('250a7499-09a6-4806-b25b-8a2c75da5a1c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Taking another piece of chalk from Mona, she hesitated, then very deliberately drew, on the floor in front of me, the single letter 'A'. 'Copy that,' she said, looking steadily at me. 'Copy it, Christy.' I couldn't. 'Try again, Chris,' she whispered in my ear. 'Again.' I did. I stiffened my body and put my left foot out again for the third time. I drew one side of the letter. I drew half of the other side. Then, the stick of chalk broke and I was left with a stump. I wanted to throw it away and give up.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d324bc45-17a4-434d-bb6c-ff49daa8306e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Then I felt my mother’s hand on my shoulder. I tried once more. Out went my foot. I shook; I sweated and stressed every muscle. But I drew the letter ‘A’. I looked up. I saw my mother’s face for a moment, tears on her cheeks. Then, my father stooped and hoisted me onto his shoulder. I had done it! It had started— the thing that was to give my mind its chance of expressing itself.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3a61075e-816f-4c31-9310-87d7bd075fd7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$True, I couldn’t speak with my lips. But now I would speak through something more lasting than spoken words — written words. That one letter scribbled on the floor with a broken bit of yellow chalk gripped between my toes, was my road to a new world, my key to mental freedom.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('96d7fd62-cf3c-43e6-aec8-83fa1c5bead7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The extract from 'My Left Foot' by Christy Brown highlights a transformative moment in the author's life, where a simple act of drawing a letter with his foot became the catalyst for his intellectual and creative awakening. This story, later adapted into a successful film starring Daniel Day-Lewis, underscores the importance of perseverance, the power of family support, and the idea that every day offers a chance to 'rewrite your story to redefine who you are.' It exemplifies competency-based learning by showing how a new skill, despite immense challenges, can unlock a person's full potential.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('76fba7f5-59ac-416f-92b1-906a831ec250', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The initial silence in the room, broken only by the unspoken tension, set the stage for a dramatic personal struggle. Christy's family members, particularly Mona and his father, were depicted in a state of watchful anticipation, their expressions conveying a mixture of concern and perhaps hope. This collective stillness amplified the significance of Christy's every move, making his eventual success a shared emotional experience for everyone present.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('52968d36-b070-4acd-b1d7-220094aa4a37', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy's mother, upon entering the room, immediately perceived the 'tension flowing through the room.' Her subsequent actions were deliberate and measured: she 'crossed over to me and kneeled beside me, as she had done so many times before.' This familiar gesture, combined with her 'strange choked way' of speaking, suggests a deep emotional connection and a history of similar supportive interventions, making her role crucial in guiding Christy through this difficult moment.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('33b1b556-cf33-42dc-904c-bbac341c3e7c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The act of drawing the letter 'A' was fraught with physical difficulty for Christy. He had to 'stiffen my body and put my left foot out again for the third time.' His attempts were marked by intense physical exertion: 'I shook; I sweated and stressed every muscle.' This vivid description highlights the extraordinary effort required for what might seem a simple task to others, underscoring the depth of his disability and the magnitude of his achievement.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f42af7e8-e761-406c-96e0-c12397000303', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The breaking of the chalk stick during Christy's second attempt was a moment of profound discouragement, leading him to 'want to throw it away and give up.' However, his mother's timely intervention—a hand on his shoulder—reignited his resolve. This small, yet powerful, gesture served as a turning point, demonstrating the critical role of external encouragement in overcoming internal despair and fostering resilience.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('bbb55355-a7e7-467d-b20b-7598f4480989', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Upon Christy's successful completion of the letter 'A', the emotional release in the room was palpable. His mother's face was momentarily seen with 'tears on her cheeks,' a silent testament to her relief and joy. His father's reaction, stooping to hoist him onto his shoulder, was a powerful affirmation of pride and acceptance. These parental responses collectively validated Christy's achievement, transforming a personal struggle into a shared moment of triumph.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1b44e9a0-a77d-47c8-834c-2d7a5c62b79b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy Brown's realization that he 'couldn't speak with my lips' but could now 'speak through something more lasting than spoken words — written words' marks a profound shift in his understanding of communication. The single letter 'A', drawn with such effort, became his 'road to a new world' and his 'key to mental freedom,' signifying not just literacy but a complete redefinition of his identity and potential for expression.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('30abb23f-dff0-460b-a687-e6485d107ea2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The extract from 'My Left Foot' is presented as an 'abridged extract,' suggesting it is a condensed version of a larger narrative. This implies that the full autobiography likely delves deeper into Christy Brown's life, his experiences with disability, and his journey. The mention of a successful film adaptation and an Academy Award for Daniel Day-Lewis further contextualizes the enduring impact and recognition of Brown's story.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7c9a3588-58f6-4a12-bc53-3f874093075f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The concluding note, 'Every day is a chance to rewrite your story to redefine who you are. English-8,' serves as a powerful motivational statement. In the context of Christy Brown's journey, this message resonates deeply, as his act of drawing the letter 'A' was precisely a moment of rewriting his own narrative, moving from a state of limited expression to one of profound intellectual and creative potential. It underscores the idea of continuous self-improvement and transformation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3e960ebc-e193-46f7-9689-4e6d7373f816', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The description of Mona, Christy's sister, with her 'black curls framing her chubby little face, staring at me with big eyes and an open mouth,' provides a glimpse into the innocent yet intense observation of a child. Her wide-eyed gaze reflects the gravity of the situation from a younger sibling's perspective, highlighting the shared family experience of Christy's challenges and triumphs.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('03645456-abf2-4cf0-b7a9-103c7bc5061b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy's father, seated across the hearth, had his 'face lit by flames,' and was 'leaning forward, his shoulders tense and his hands outspread on his knees.' This posture and description suggest a man deeply invested in the unfolding events, experiencing a mixture of anxiety and hope. His physical tension mirrors the emotional tension in the room, making his eventual act of hoisting Christy onto his shoulder a powerful release and affirmation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a91a71cc-d008-4f17-a3de-146b93df6313', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The mother's decision to take 'another piece of chalk from Mona' before drawing the letter 'A' is a subtle but important detail. It suggests a practical, resourceful approach, ensuring she had the necessary tool for the task. Her subsequent hesitation before 'very deliberately' drawing the letter indicates the weight of the moment and the careful consideration she gave to this crucial first step in Christy's learning journey.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1562f66d-00e9-49ce-8d1b-9cf1a8858d9b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy's internal struggle was evident in his desire to 'throw it away and give up' after the chalk broke. This moment of despair is a common human reaction to failure and frustration. However, the narrative emphasizes that this was not the end, but a challenge to be overcome, highlighting the universal theme of resilience in the face of setbacks.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4c8df1e6-75af-4e39-baaa-04fedb219165', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The description of Christy's physical sensations—'I shook; I sweated and stressed every muscle'—during his final attempt to draw the letter 'A' vividly conveys the intensity of his effort. This raw portrayal of his struggle allows the reader to deeply empathize with his experience, making his ultimate success all the more impactful and inspiring. It underscores that significant achievements often require immense personal sacrifice and exertion.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c277bdef-e0d2-4c82-9224-3444c660b063', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The tears on his mother's cheeks after Christy successfully drew the letter 'A' were a powerful, non-verbal expression of her profound relief, joy, and perhaps the culmination of years of hope and struggle. These tears, seen by Christy, likely reinforced the magnitude of his achievement and the depth of his mother's love and belief in him, creating a lasting emotional bond around this pivotal moment.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7d4a175e-1455-4ac9-8452-c1b1ad19f18e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The final sentence of the extract, 'That one letter scribbled on the floor with a broken bit of yellow chalk gripped between my toes, was my road to a new world, my key to mental freedom,' encapsulates the entire narrative's core message. It highlights the transformative power of a seemingly small act, the symbolism of the tools used, and the profound personal liberation achieved through literacy, offering a powerful conclusion to Christy's initial journey.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e84ccea4-98cb-4b3c-9e1f-b8acb11e4bed', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story of Christy Brown is often cited as an example of overcoming extreme physical adversity to achieve intellectual and creative fulfillment. His journey, from being unable to speak to becoming a renowned author, challenges societal perceptions of disability and intelligence. It underscores the importance of looking beyond physical limitations to recognize and nurture an individual's inherent potential, regardless of their circumstances.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('801a9486-c610-40e8-9ffa-96048fb8804e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'the thing that was to give my mind its chance of expressing itself' signifies a profound internal shift for Christy. Prior to this moment, his mind was active but largely confined, unable to articulate its thoughts and feelings. The act of writing provided the conduit, the mechanism through which his inner world could finally connect with the outer world, marking the birth of his intellectual voice.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ac25ac41-8240-47d3-ac01-d27c2d934e44', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story implicitly highlights the difference between physical ability and intellectual capacity. While Christy's body presented significant challenges, his mind was clearly capable and eager to learn. The narrative focuses on the triumph of his intellect and spirit over physical constraints, demonstrating that true ability resides not just in physical prowess but in the power of the mind and will.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('408b3f32-0071-4b94-b639-a49d7b150b18', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Letter ‘A’ inspire all. I was born in the Rotunda Hospital on June 5th, 1932. It was my mother who first saw that there was something wrong with me. I was about four months old at the time. She noticed that my head had a habit of falling backwards whenever she tried to feed me. That was the first warning sign. Then, she became aware of other defects as I got older. She saw that my hands were clenched nearly all the time. They were inclined to twine behind my back. My mouth couldn’t grasp the neck of the bottle because even at that early age, my jaws would either lock together tightly so that she couldn’t open them or they would suddenly become limp and fall loose, dragging my whole mouth to one side. At six months, I could not sit up without having a mountain of pillows around me. At twelve months, it was the same. Almost every doctor who saw and examined me labelled me a very interesting but also a hopeless case. Many told my mother very gently that I was mentally defective and would remain so. That was a hard blow to a young mother who had already reared five healthy children. The doctors were so very sure of themselves that Mother’s faith in me seemed almost impertinent. How would you react to the doctor’s observation if you had been in the author’s mother’s place? Finding that the doctors could not help in any way, the mother decided to take matters into her own hands. I was her child and, therefore, a part of the family. English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 27, NULL),
  ('b993934b-9e8d-415a-90f3-61863e0863b0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$That was a momentous decision as far as my future life was concerned. It meant that | would always have my mother on my side to help me fight all the battles that were to come and to inspire me with new strength when | was almost beaten. | was now five and still, | showed no real sign of intelligence. | showed no interest in things except with my toes, more especially those of my left foot. Although my natural habits were clean, | could not aid myself, but in this respect, my father took care of me. | always lie on my back in the kitchen or, on bright, warm days, out in the garden, a little bundle of crooked muscles and twisted nerves. Then suddenly, it happened! In a moment, everything was changed; my future life moulded into a definite shape, my mother’s faith in me was rewarded and her secret fear became an open triumph. It happened so quickly, so simply, | can see and feel the whole scene as if it had happened last week. It was the afternoon of a cold, grey December day. The dull, murky English-8 sky stretched like a dark canopy, a vast infinity of greyness. Inside, the entire family gathered around the large kitchen fire. Mona and Paddy were sitting, huddled together, a few torn school textbooks before them. They were writing down little sums onto an old chiselled slate, using a bright piece of yellow chalk. | was close to them, supported by a few pillows against the wall, watching. It was the chalk that attracted me so much. | had never seen anything like it before and it showed up so well against the slate’s black surface that | was fascinated by it as much as if it were a stick of gold. Do you think the author will ever be able to read and write like his siblings? What does the future hold for him? Suddenly, without thinking or knowing exactly what | was doing, | reached out and took the stick of chalk out of my sister’s hand with my left foot. | held it tightly between my toes and, acting impulsively, made a wild sort of scribble with it on the slate. Then | looked up and$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
