  ('3418f349-9129-4b3b-ae38-b911bdecf1f2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$That was a momentous decision as far as my future life was concerned. It meant that | would always have my mother on my side to help me fight all the battles that were to come and to inspire me with new strength when | was almost beaten. | was now five and still, | showed no real sign of intelligence. | showed no interest in things except with my toes, more especially those of my left foot. Although my natural habits were clean, | could not aid myself, but in this respect, my father took care of me. | always lie on my back in the kitchen or, on bright, warm days, out in the garden, a little bundle of crooked muscles and twisted nerves. Then suddenly, it happened! In a moment, everything was changed; my future life moulded into a definite shape, my mother’s faith in me was rewarded and her secret fear became an open triumph. It happened so quickly, so simply, | can see and feel the whole scene as if it had happened last week. It was the afternoon of a cold, grey December day. The dull, murky English-8 sky stretched like a dark canopy, a vast infinity of greyness. Inside, the entire family gathered around the large kitchen fire. Mona and Paddy were sitting, huddled together, a few torn school textbooks before them. They were writing down little sums onto an old chiselled slate, using a bright piece of yellow chalk. | was close to them, supported by a few pillows against the wall, watching. It was the chalk that attracted me so much. | had never seen anything like it before and it showed up so well against the slate’s black surface that | was fascinated by it as much as if it were a stick of gold. Do you think the author will ever be able to read and write like his siblings? What does the future hold for him? Suddenly, without thinking or knowing exactly what | was doing, | reached out and took the stick of chalk out of my sister’s hand with my left foot. | held it tightly between my toes and, acting impulsively, made a wild sort of scribble with it on the slate. Then | looked up and$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('5b1dfdd7-1376-4786-9f63-f2ba2b6a9831', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Everyone had stopped talking and was staring at me silently. Nobody moved. Mona, her black curls framing her chubby little face, staring at me with big eyes and an open mouth. Across the open hearth, his face lit by flames, sat my father, leaning forward, his shoulders tense and his hands outspread on his knees. I felt the sweat break out on my forehead. My mother came in from the pantry. She stopped midway between the table and the fire, feeling the tension flowing through the room. Her eyes looked from my face down to my foot, with the chalk gripped between my toes.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('64c0c3de-f70d-44e4-b9eb-e637d449b717', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$She crossed over to me and kneeled beside me, as she had done so many times before. ‘I’ll show you what to do with it, Chris,’ she said, very slowly and in a strange choked way, her face flushed as if with some inner excitement. Taking another piece of chalk from Mona, she hesitated, then very deliberately drew, on the floor in front of me, the single letter ‘A’. ‘Copy that,’ she said, looking steadily at me. ‘Copy it, Christy.’ I couldn't.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1f7a832c-d4c1-48bc-9499-9eea32ca700e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$‘Try again, Chris,’ she whispered in my ear. ‘Again.’ I did. I stiffened my body and put my left foot out again for the third time. I drew one side of the letter. I drew half of the other side. Then, the stick of chalk broke and I was left with a stump. I wanted to throw it away and give up. Then I felt my mother’s hand on my shoulder. I tried once more. Out went my foot. I shook; I sweated and stressed every muscle. But I drew the letter ‘A’.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('33b0d50a-011b-47b1-a272-73630f2b40d4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$I looked up. I saw my mother’s face for a moment, tears on her cheeks. Then, my father stooped and hoisted me onto his shoulder. I had done it! It had started— the thing that was to give my mind its chance of expressing itself. True, I couldn’t speak with my lips. But now I would speak through something more lasting than spoken words — written words.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('754ded3a-a5d4-46d2-b243-aaf7c2025a0c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$That one letter scribbled on the floor with a broken bit of yellow chalk gripped between my toes, was my road to a new world, my key to mental freedom. —an abridged extract from ‘My Left Foot’ written by Christy Brown (Edited) da | sted toa successful film with the same name, starring Daniel “ Jan Academy Award forhis portrayal of Brown. His wo 5 ab ‘lity, family and personal struggle. COMPETENCY-BASED LEARNING Every day is a chance to rewrite your story to redefine who you are. English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f1dc97f1-6ec3-48d4-98e1-9c5f8854241e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story of Christy Brown, as depicted in this extract, is a powerful testament to human perseverance and the transformative power of education and support. Despite severe physical limitations that prevented him from speaking, Christy found his voice through the arduous process of learning to write with his foot. This journey, initiated by his mother's patient guidance and culminating in a moment of shared family triumph, opened up a 'new world' of expression and 'mental freedom' for him.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('fd4c9481-3244-40b5-99e5-d14ee22e808b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The initial tension in the room, with everyone staring silently at Christy, highlights the unspoken challenges and expectations surrounding his condition. His father's tense posture and Mona's wide-eyed gaze underscore the family's deep emotional investment. It was the mother's empathetic understanding and deliberate action that broke this tension, setting in motion a series of events that would forever alter Christy's path, demonstrating the profound impact of a supportive environment.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6fe1f378-8974-44bf-90f7-b33228acfd92', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy's struggle to draw the letter 'A' was not merely a physical one; it was an emotional battle against frustration and the urge to give up. The breaking of the chalk symbolized a moment of crisis, pushing him to the brink of despair. However, his mother's gentle touch and persistent encouragement provided the crucial impetus for him to 'try once more,' illustrating the power of external motivation in overcoming internal resistance.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('872da604-71e6-4893-a640-d54f50bb90b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The triumph of drawing the letter 'A' was a watershed moment, not just for Christy but for his entire family. His mother's tears and father's proud embrace were testaments to their shared journey and the collective joy of witnessing his breakthrough. This achievement transcended the simple act of writing; it was the 'start' of his mind's ability to express itself, paving the way for a life where written words would become his enduring legacy, as celebrated in his autobiography and its film adaptation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('62d69cdf-47d1-4fb7-8d49-4b554648297f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative emphasizes the contrast between Christy's inability to speak with his lips and his eventual ability to communicate through written words. This highlights the idea that communication is not limited to conventional forms and that alternative methods can be equally, if not more, powerful and lasting. The 'broken bit of yellow chalk' and his 'left foot' became the unconventional tools for unlocking a profound and enduring voice.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('8c8ffe72-47d0-4278-bb3c-9c370d6a5618', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy Brown's life story, encapsulated in this extract, is a powerful illustration of the human spirit's capacity to overcome profound adversity. His journey from a state of limited expression to becoming an acclaimed author and artist serves as an inspiration, demonstrating that physical challenges do not define one's intellectual potential or capacity for self-realization. The story encourages us to look beyond apparent limitations and embrace the possibility of 'rewriting your story' through perseverance and support.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3492185c-c9ad-4f3e-a5f7-683638f30220', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The detailed description of Christy's physical effort—'I stiffened my body and put my left foot out again for the third time. I drew one side of the letter. I drew half of the other side. Then, the stick of chalk broke... I shook; I sweated and stressed every muscle'—serves to immerse the reader in his arduous experience. This vivid imagery not only conveys the intensity of his struggle but also amplifies the emotional impact of his eventual success, making his triumph feel hard-earned and deeply personal.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d906d704-f7b8-41bc-93e2-ff79e4974314', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The mother's 'strange choked way' of speaking and her 'face flushed as if with some inner excitement' when she instructed Christy to copy the letter 'A' reveals her deep emotional investment and perhaps a suppressed hope or anticipation. This subtle portrayal of her internal state suggests that she recognized the profound potential of this moment, understanding that it could be a turning point for her son, a chance to unlock his hidden abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('36fd6d79-5344-4ec7-bc07-7eab9e4d287d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'key to mental freedom' is a powerful metaphor for the liberation Christy experienced through literacy. Before this, his thoughts and intellect were confined, unable to be fully expressed. Learning to write provided him with the means to unlock his inner world, to share his ideas, and to connect with others on an intellectual level, thereby granting him a profound sense of autonomy and self-worth.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('802aa4f3-4630-4428-a0ff-69f628c30d27', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story highlights the importance of recognizing and nurturing potential, even in the face of significant challenges. Christy's mother did not dismiss his attempts or his unusual method of holding chalk; instead, she provided the guidance and encouragement needed to transform a seemingly impossible task into a foundational skill. This approach underscores the value of individualized support and belief in a person's inherent capabilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2767d16e-067c-4e8d-8f02-19d644258a4d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative arc of the extract moves from tension and struggle to triumph and profound realization. The initial silence and stares, Christy's repeated failures, and the breaking of the chalk all build dramatic tension. This tension is then released through his ultimate success, followed by the emotional reactions of his parents and Christy's own epiphany about written words. This structure effectively conveys the journey from confinement to liberation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('32343b18-cec9-4016-b44a-711b014bd4da', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy Brown's autobiography and its film adaptation have played a crucial role in raising awareness about cerebral palsy and the capabilities of individuals with disabilities. By sharing his personal story of struggle and triumph, Brown provided a voice for many who might otherwise remain unheard. The recognition through an Academy Award further amplified this message, fostering greater understanding and empathy in society.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('fb560c19-5326-4440-ad8b-7a9c73cac41d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'Every day is a chance to rewrite your story to redefine who you are' serves as a powerful concluding thought, connecting Christy's specific experience to a universal principle of self-improvement and transformation. It suggests that personal identity is not fixed but can be actively shaped through effort, resilience, and the pursuit of new possibilities, much like Christy redefined his own capabilities through the act of writing.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c99ed16b-789f-4d2f-b279-cbcb2b3e1ac3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The description of Christy's father, with his 'face lit by flames' and 'shoulders tense,' portrays him as a silent but deeply engaged observer. His eventual act of hoisting Christy onto his shoulder after the success is a powerful, non-verbal expression of pride and acceptance, signifying a shift from anxious anticipation to joyous affirmation. This demonstrates the father's emotional journey alongside his son.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('58ab7609-8bf5-41a8-9fde-6b0ce1c6751a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mona's reaction, 'staring at me with big eyes and an open mouth,' provides a child's perspective on the intense family moment. Her innocent yet focused gaze highlights the shared nature of Christy's struggle within the family unit. Her presence underscores that even the youngest members were acutely aware of the gravity of the situation, making Christy's triumph a collective family experience.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('447b01f4-597d-41bc-8b68-6ff874ed029b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The mother's 'strange choked way' of speaking and her 'face flushed as if with some inner excitement' when addressing Christy about the chalk are crucial details. They suggest a profound emotional state, perhaps a mix of hope, anxiety, and a deep understanding of the potential breakthrough. This subtle portrayal of her inner turmoil and anticipation adds depth to her character and highlights the emotional weight of the moment.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f8d61b3f-d2e8-4c39-a923-281f21b1bb99', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Christy's internal monologue, 'I couldn't,' and 'I wanted to throw it away and give up,' provides direct insight into his moments of self-doubt and frustration. These honest admissions make his eventual success more relatable and inspiring, as they portray a realistic struggle rather than an effortless triumph. It emphasizes that even with strong motivation, the path to achievement often involves moments of despair.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('132e0ea8-2519-4c2f-92c7-27d9851cfe48', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'broken bit of yellow chalk' is a powerful symbol in the narrative. Initially, its breaking represents a setback, almost leading Christy to give up. However, the fact that he ultimately uses this very 'stump' to complete the letter 'A' transforms it into a symbol of resilience, resourcefulness, and the ability to achieve greatness even with imperfect tools. It underscores that limitations can be overcome with determination.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7000dc53-2905-4071-a1c7-a57b929ab484', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'more lasting than spoken words — written words' highlights a central theme of the extract: the enduring power of the written word. For Christy, who could not speak, writing offered not just a means of communication but a way to create a permanent record of his thoughts and experiences, ensuring his voice would be heard and remembered long after the fleeting nature of speech. This concept is further reinforced by his autobiography and its lasting impact.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('eb0b4938-8a78-4308-8945-5d5989bfefbf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story of Christy Brown is often used in educational contexts to inspire students and illustrate principles of perseverance and overcoming adversity. The inclusion of 'COMPETENCY-BASED LEARNING' and 'Every day is a chance to rewrite your story to redefine who you are' at the end of the extract suggests its pedagogical purpose: to encourage students to embrace challenges, develop new skills, and understand that their potential is limitless.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e4660b15-7883-4b63-963b-6254c54b2103', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative's focus on Christy's 'left foot' as the instrument of his breakthrough is crucial. It emphasizes his unique physical challenges and the extraordinary adaptation he developed. This detail not only grounds the story in his specific disability but also elevates the act of writing with his foot into a symbol of personal ingenuity and the triumph of will over physical constraint, making his achievement all the more remarkable.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e0695d9d-0fd9-415c-8bda-bc3915c25d11', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The extract from 'My Left Foot' is a testament to the power of a single, decisive moment to alter the course of a life. The drawing of the letter 'A' was not an isolated event but the 'start' of a profound journey, a 'road to a new world' that allowed Christy Brown to express his intellect and creativity. This moment serves as a powerful reminder that breakthroughs often begin with small, courageous steps and the unwavering support of those who believe in one's potential.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL);
