  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the initial presentation of the author's condition, detailing the specific symptoms observed by the mother and their chronological appearance.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '66aecfce-bb20-40e1-afaf-c67010e64b56', NULL, 1),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the medical community's response to the author's condition, including their diagnosis and the implications of their prognosis for the family.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '66aecfce-bb20-40e1-afaf-c67010e64b56', NULL, 2),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '588b178f-9fcc-4465-bd6d-81d8a732056c', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Evaluate the mother's character and decision-making process in this challenging situation. What factors contributed to her resolve to personally intervene?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-545Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '66aecfce-bb20-40e1-afaf-c67010e64b56', NULL, 3),
